  dilaogueLines:
  - "What\u2019s that? You want me to let you in? "
  - Yeah right in your dreams buddy, keep dreaming!
  - "You really thought I\u2019d just let you in?"
  - You must be some kind of buffoon huh?!
  - ...
  - ...
  - '*sigh*'
  - Sorry...
  - "I\u2019m not usually a rude person, its just\u2026"
  - "I lost my bestfriend recently and it\u2019s just not been the same without him. "
  - What? No he's not dead, he's just lost.
  - I'm talking about my cat, Fredrick
  - I accidentally left the door to my house open and he wandered out.
  - "I haven\u2019t been able to find him since. "
  - ...
  - I miss him...
  - Anyways, you can't come in.
  - Scram!
